Date: Thu, 15 Dec 2022 23:28:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dsound: Initialize primary buffer with device's channel
 layout

Fixes surround sound in some games, like Borderlands GOTY and Dead
Space.

(cherry picked from commit 30eff97709373246d6c17e1ab1d83e6350db0250)
mproton-resolved: moved 11.20's DSOUND_ParseSpeakerConfig() (which adds the 7.1 layouts) to primary.c instead of Proton's older 5.1-only copy.
---
 dlls/dsound/dsound.c         | 119 +----------------------------------
 dlls/dsound/dsound_private.h |   1 -
 dlls/dsound/primary.c        | 117 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 118 insertions(+), 119 deletions(-)

